  "description": "30-year-old virgin Hong Sera is invited to join the beta test of a mysterious game, “Imaginary Sex Kingdom.” Once she presses “Play,” she awakens as Princess Chloe, surrounded by three irresistible suitors—Lucas, Aiden, and Maverick. With beauty and grace, she captures each of their hearts, but the more she indulges in their affection, the harder it becomes to choose just one. Little does she know that in this kingdom of desire and temptation, even her wildest fantasies can come true…\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Sunae(純愛) Danpyeonseon (순애(純愛) 단편선) Collection.*",
